                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-chess">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="achievement-card eff-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">GRIT</div><div class="ach-icon">↗</div>
                                <h3>Against the Odds</h3>
                                <p>Lowest positive average — still in the arena.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-effort">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="achievement-card gli-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">WILDCARD</div><div class="ach-icon">⚡</div>
                                <h3>Glitch in Matrix</h3>
                                <p>Unexpected behavior.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-glitch">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="achievement-card runner-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">CHASE PACK</div><div class="ach-icon">Ⅱ</div>
                                <h3>Hot on the Heels</h3><p>Second place on the global leaderboard.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-runner">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="achievement-card balance-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">ALL-ROUNDER</div><div class="ach-icon">◆</div>
                                <h3>Three-Arena Leader</h3><p>Highest canonical Overall score in the current dataset.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-balanced">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="achievement-card specialist-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">SPECIALIST</div><div class="ach-icon">✦</div>
                                <h3>One-Trick Wonder</h3><p>Largest gap between best and worst arena.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-specialist">Loading...</span></div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="achievement-card depth-card">
                                <div class="ach-ribbon">ENDURANCE</div><div class="ach-icon">∞</div>
                                <h3>Marathon Mind</h3><p>Most scored trials across the benchmark suite.</p>
                                <div class="ach-model"><span id="ach-depth">Loading...</span></div>
