                            </aside>
                        </div>
                        <p class="journey-clarification" role="note"><span aria-hidden="true">i</span>The model’s position reflects its Ultimate Bench score. Milestone names and interpretations are illustrative, not validated AGI thresholds.</p>
                    </section>



                    <hr style="border: 0; height: 1px; background-image: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0)); margin: 3rem 0;" />


                    <div class="home-grid">
                        {[
                            { id: 'visual', title: 'VISUAL BENCH', rows: visualArenaRows.filter(row => row.rank !== null) },
                            { id: 'data', title: 'DATA RETRIEVAL BENCH', rows: dataArenaRows.filter(row => row.rank !== null) },
