        <aside class="disclaimer benchmark-status-legend" aria-labelledby="benchmark-status-title"><h2 id="benchmark-status-title">Benchmark status legend</h2><p><strong>Active:</strong> operational and scored. <strong>Planned:</strong> protocol not yet defined; its reserved weight earns zero without a model result. <strong>Locked:</strong> protocol exists but is not operational; its reserved weight earns zero without a model result. <strong>Invalid:</strong> attempted evaluation failed its validity rule; aggregated as zero with weight retained. <strong>Unavailable:</strong> active evaluation could not run; earns zero while denominator 63 remains fixed. <strong>Not tested:</strong> not attempted; earns zero while denominator 63 remains fixed and coverage is incomplete. A numeric 0% is a valid result and retains its weight.</p><p><strong>Claude 5 Fable (high):</strong> recorded active-level results are included in all three arenas; no unavailable or not-tested value affects its current qualification.</p></aside>
